      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LUSKIN ROSE (8) jumped from the inside and boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten a nose (23.30) behind Frankie's Angel at The Gardens. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Top prospect. LIKE A PORSHA (1) draws the rails and gets chance to find form. Last time finished last over 400m at this track beaten 7 lengths (23.37) behind Roman Fly in a Maiden on August 3. Good beginner assisted by the inside draw. Can figure in the finish. TENNESSEE FLYER (2) produced a moderate run last time when fifth at this track over 400m behind Canya Scandal (23.31) in a Maiden. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Deserves plenty of respect. UNDER A SPELL (6) can return to form after missing the top-three at this circuit last time out.",
